# ─── Model checkpoints ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# saved_models/ is ~3.8 GB and six files individually exceed GitHub's 100 MB
# hard limit (VGG16_last.pth alone is 1.6 GB), so a push containing them is
# rejected outright. Weights are reproducible from train.py; the repo ships the
# code that makes them, not the artifacts.
#
# To publish one small model so the app runs straight after a clone, force-add
# it explicitly, e.g.:
#     git add -f saved_models/EfficientNetB0_best.pth   # 16 MB
#     git add -f saved_models/MobileNetV3_best.pth      # 17 MB
saved_models/
*.pth
*.pt
*.onnx

# ─── OOD calibration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The .json files are small and worth versioning - they record the temperature,
# thresholds and ECE that back the abstention claims. The .npz sidecars hold
# dense precision matrices (AlexNet's is 46 MB, 80 MB in total) and are
# regenerated by  python calibrate_ood.py  in minutes.
results/*.npz

# ─── Datasets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PlantVillage/
field_data/**
!field_data/README.md
uploads/
captures/

# ─── Training logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
runs/
events.out.tfevents.*

# ─── Scratch output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
smoke_test_out/
results/gradcam_*.png
results/*_gradcam_*.png

# ─── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── Virtual environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# ─── Editor / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local History extension artifacts - editor state, not project state.
.history/
.lh/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
